with action controls variable scoping.
with action can allow you to set the current scope (.) to a particular object.

with action Syntax
{{ with PIPELINE }}
  # restricted scope
{{ end }}

Example: add this in values.yaml
# For testing Flow Control: with 
podAnnotations: 
  appName: myapp1
  appType: webserver
  appTech: HTML

- and then in deployment.yaml add
  template:
    metadata:
      {{- with .Values.podAnnotations }}
      annotations:
        {{- toYaml . | nindent 8 }}        
      {{- end }}    
